  /**************************************************************************
   *
   * @function:
   *   FT_Get_CMap_Format
   *
   * @description:
   *   Return the format of an SFNT 'cmap' table.
   *
   * @input:
   *   charmap ::
   *     The target charmap.
   *
   * @return:
   *   The format of `charmap`.  If `charmap` doesn't belong to an SFNT face,
